{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id163022802"}, "name":{"label":"Christine0823"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-01-10T18:59:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.7.6"}, "id":{"label":"12169596573"}, "title":{"label":"An Excellent Option for Meetings!"}, "content":{"label":"I tried out a couple of transcription programs before finding Wave, including Otter AI. I did not like that other AI apps required me to have a bot in my meetings as there were some issues with people allowing the bot into the meeting, or not noticing the request. \n\nWave allows me to record using my microphone on my personal device, which is super handy in both in-person meetings and online meetings. I just simply press record and leave my phone out during the meeting and it catches everything. The one thing to be mindful of is if someone calls your phone, the app will pause the recording and you need to resume it. The transcriptions are quite accurate. \n\nThe summaries and the transcript can both be edited, which is a huge bonus.\n\nThere is a webpage for the app where you can sign in with your Apple or Google play ID and you can edit your summary. There is a chat feature where it tells you that you can make suggestions or give feedback. \n\nTonight I wrote in the chat that I would appreciate being able to identify the speakers on the webpage like I can in the app. I did not expect a direct response, let alone a response on a Friday night at 9 PM (my time). To my shock and amazement, the founder of the app responded directly to me. I told Josh how much I appreciate the app and amazingly, within an hour he had updated the webpage so that I can identify speakers, and he added the AI chat onto the webpage so I can ask it questions regarding my recording. \n\nThis is above and beyond what I suspected when I purchased my Premium membership. \n\nI highly recommend this app to anyone who struggles with taking notes in meetings. As someone with an ADHD diagnosis, meetings and note taking have always been my nemesis. I am proud to say this is not the case any longer thanks to Wave: AI Note Taker. \n\nThanks again Josh!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=6451491556&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"3"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"4"}}, 
